    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1775">

                <pb facs="1445" n="1329" xml:id="pg1329"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 033.1100 K77/71.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the American
                        Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-03-04">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 4, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Secretary of State and his party will arrive March 10 at Acajutla, will
                    remain at San Salvador the 11th and 12th, and will leave on the 13th for San
                    José, Guatemala.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
